<title>USA: Marina LP Q4 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Marina LP Q4 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.36		    $0.71</p>
<p> Net			    238			480</p>
<p> Revs			   405		    1,463</p>
<p>		YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $4.49		    $6.50</p>
<p> Net			  3,034		    4,391</p>
<p> Revs			 7,691		   10,077</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for fiscal 1996 decreased because the company received less gain from the sale of commercial property.  Gains from the sale of property in 1996 were $40,000, as compared to $498,000 in 1995.</p>
